SUMMARY:Here Comes Santa Claus
LOCATION:Peace Plaza\, 1st Ave SW & 2nd St SW\, Rochester\, MN 55902
DESCRIPTION:Downtown's 52nd annual Santa kickoff: Mrs. Claus' Workshop wit
 h Nutcracker performances at the Historic Chateau Theatre (2:30–4:45 p.m
 .)\, Santa's rescue at Old City Hall at 5\, the Peace Plaza tree lighting 
 at 5:15\, then photos with Santa at the Galleria until 7. See details. Det
 ails: https://weekendscout.app/e/rochester-mn/here-comes-santa-claus-2026-
 11/
URL:https://weekendscout.app/e/rochester-mn/here-comes-santa-claus-2026-11/
